# Phase 08 — Settings & hardening

## Goal

Complete gym/owner/plan settings and run a hardening pass on security, UX states, and accessibility.

## Tasks

- Gym settings: name, contact, address, INR, timezone, receipt details.
- Owner profile; plan settings.
- Hardening: rerun RLS tests; check logs for leaked secrets or personal data; verify all loading/empty/error states; touch targets and contrast.

## Done when

- [ ] Gym, owner, and plan settings editable and persisted
- [ ] RLS tests re-run and pass
- [ ] No secrets or personal data leaked in logs
- [ ] Loading / empty / error states present across flows
- [ ] Touch targets and contrast meet UI standards
- [ ] Lint, typecheck, and tests pass

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
